WEBVTT

00:20.640 --> 00:22.520
CHILDREN AND WOMEN'S DISEASES

00:33.560 --> 00:35.960
Everyone likes to think
they're a good person.

00:36.960 --> 00:39.960
But good can't exist without evil.

00:41.200 --> 00:43.960
Pleasure without pain.

00:50.680 --> 00:53.240
Humans are not
some noble creatures

00:53.320 --> 00:55.000
only capable of good.

00:55.080 --> 00:59.120
They have a dark,
filthy soul heading deep inside…

01:00.840 --> 01:02.560
…begging to come out.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.720
Given the opportunity, they might just do
bad things to get what they want.

01:11.800 --> 01:15.960
But don't ever forget,
that when you play with fire… 

01:18.360 --> 01:19.920
you will get burned.

02:46.040 --> 02:48.360
In conclusion,
our experiment worked.

02:48.440 --> 02:52.560
We made students watch a Buddhism video
that encourage them to meditate.

02:52.640 --> 02:56.000
It increased their concentration
and has received positive feedbacks

02:56.080 --> 02:57.960
from both students and parents.

02:58.040 --> 03:01.720
Now to success,
our school is more equipped

03:01.800 --> 03:04.240
to greet students
with new innovative teaching methods.

03:05.480 --> 03:06.840
That's fantastic, Win.

03:07.960 --> 03:11.920
Thanks to you, other schools are using
our meditation model, too.

03:13.120 --> 03:15.720
This experiment has been
a tremendous success.

03:15.800 --> 03:17.520
And the press
about the project

03:17.600 --> 03:19.240
has been phenomenal.

03:19.320 --> 03:22.080
Win, thank you for everything you've done.

03:22.160 --> 03:24.000
Uh… You're welcome.

03:24.080 --> 03:25.080
Thanks a lot.

03:27.640 --> 03:29.440
Anyone else have something to say?

03:30.400 --> 03:31.480
Uh…

03:31.960 --> 03:36.200
I'd like to suggest a similar project
to teach students about safe sex.

03:37.640 --> 03:40.280
These are some notes
that I have prepared about the proposal.

03:41.640 --> 03:42.840
Please take a look.

03:45.080 --> 03:47.840
Are you suggesting we have condom
vending machines in the school?

03:47.920 --> 03:51.440
Yes. Condoms will protect
our students from STDs

03:51.520 --> 03:53.160
and prevent pregnancies.

03:53.240 --> 03:55.920
In this day and age, students need
to learn how to have safe sex.

03:56.000 --> 03:57.560
I can't believe what I'm hearing.

03:57.640 --> 04:00.160
This disgusting idea
is coming from a young woman.

04:00.240 --> 04:01.880
Excuse me, Jib.

04:01.960 --> 04:04.520
This project has nothing to do
with my gender.

04:04.600 --> 04:06.320
Please just focus on the content.

04:06.400 --> 04:07.640
You're not preventing it,

04:07.720 --> 04:09.520
you're encouraging them.

04:09.600 --> 04:12.360
But we can't force kids
at this age not to think about sex.

04:12.920 --> 04:14.080
They're teenagers.

04:14.800 --> 04:18.200
But it might make innocent students
who have never even thought about sex

04:18.280 --> 04:20.480
to think that they should
probably be doing it too.

04:20.960 --> 04:23.720
If you would please read
my entire proposal, Troe,

04:23.800 --> 04:27.440
you will see there are
many other aspects to this campaign.

04:27.520 --> 04:29.240
It's not just a condom vending machine.

04:31.040 --> 04:32.280
What you've proposed

04:32.360 --> 04:34.880
will only make our students
more obsessed with sex.

04:34.960 --> 04:38.760
A teacher with this point of view
is harmful to our students.

04:39.280 --> 04:40.520
You should be fired.

04:41.640 --> 04:43.400
Well, I think we should take a step back.

04:43.960 --> 04:46.240
Actually, I can understand
both sides here.

04:46.320 --> 04:48.120
First of all,
we should carefully examine

04:48.200 --> 04:50.400
all the pros and cons of this proposal.

04:50.480 --> 04:53.600
But instead of making any decisions
about this project right now,

04:53.680 --> 04:57.800
why don't we create
another video lesson in the meantime?

04:58.360 --> 05:00.320
The video could suggest daily activities

05:00.400 --> 05:03.960
and meditation techniques
that would be beneficial to the students.

05:04.040 --> 05:06.560
We could use yoga
and mindful breathing.

05:06.640 --> 05:08.760
It would calm them down,
take their minds off sex,

05:08.840 --> 05:12.320
and help them concentrate on their studies
and extracurricular activities.

05:13.040 --> 05:15.600
It will guide the students to live
more mindful lives.

05:16.880 --> 05:18.680
Now, I think
that is a good idea.

05:18.760 --> 05:22.040
Only last year, I'm proud to say

05:22.120 --> 05:25.320
our school was named
"Purest School of the Year".

05:25.400 --> 05:27.200
We should build on that distinction

05:27.280 --> 05:30.800
and continue to be a good role model
for other schools in the country.

05:30.880 --> 05:32.080
As for you, Mali…

05:41.480 --> 05:43.760
Hello there, I'm Nanno.

05:45.480 --> 05:47.000
It's nice to meet you all.

05:49.440 --> 05:51.640
Good. Nanno,
why don't you sit next to Mei.

05:52.520 --> 05:53.680
Take a seat.

05:53.760 --> 05:55.000
-Okay.
-Okay.

05:56.640 --> 05:59.720
Win will be your homeroom teacher
for the next two weeks.

06:00.200 --> 06:01.920
Make sure you behave, okay?

06:02.000 --> 06:05.280
Don't give him a headache.
Do you understand?

06:08.960 --> 06:11.280
Yes, Win? What is it?

06:11.360 --> 06:12.640
Can I talk to your class?

06:12.720 --> 06:13.840
Oh, yeah, of course.

06:14.480 --> 06:15.920
Good morning, everyone.

06:16.000 --> 06:19.000
I'm looking for some volunteers
to help me with the video I'm shooting

06:19.080 --> 06:20.800
about yoga for meditation.

06:21.360 --> 06:24.360
It would be great to have a few students
who already has some experience,

06:24.440 --> 06:25.440
basic yoga.

06:25.920 --> 06:26.760
Anyone interested?

06:26.840 --> 06:27.840
I love yoga!

06:28.800 --> 06:30.120
Thank you so much.

06:30.200 --> 06:31.200
Anyone else?

06:36.520 --> 06:38.840
Are you a new student?
Why haven't I seen you before?

06:38.920 --> 06:40.480
Oh, today is her first day.

06:40.560 --> 06:41.640
Her name is Nanno.

06:41.720 --> 06:43.000
Oh, Nanno.

06:43.920 --> 06:45.160
That's a cute name.

06:45.240 --> 06:46.280
Thank you, Nanno.

06:46.840 --> 06:48.360
Is there anyone else?

06:48.880 --> 06:50.080
Hmm…

06:50.160 --> 06:51.520
How about Mei?

06:52.040 --> 06:53.400
You do yoga, don't you?

06:54.240 --> 06:56.720
And you've helped Mr. Win
when he shot his last video too.

06:56.800 --> 06:58.280
-Isn't that right?
-Yeah.

06:59.120 --> 07:02.600
Mei seems to be busy. That's all right.
Two people are enough.

07:02.680 --> 07:04.440
Okay. Two students, then.

07:04.520 --> 07:05.640
-Okay.
-Good.

07:05.720 --> 07:08.280
Both of you, please meet me
at the video lab after school.

07:08.880 --> 07:11.440
We'll rehearse and film
for an hour and a half each day.

07:11.520 --> 07:13.400
-Sounds good?
-Yeah.

07:14.040 --> 07:15.120
Thank you, everyone.

07:15.200 --> 07:17.160
-Thank you, Mali.
-Thank you.

07:23.920 --> 07:24.960
Hey.

07:25.760 --> 07:27.560
He really is the cutest, isn't he?

07:27.640 --> 07:30.200
It's too bad, he's already married.

07:30.760 --> 07:31.760
Oh, really?

07:50.480 --> 07:52.160
Okay. Next position.

07:59.640 --> 08:01.360
Let me adjust you a bit.

08:02.320 --> 08:03.560
You're okay, right?

08:04.080 --> 08:05.680
All right, Nanno, can you stand up?

08:08.840 --> 08:09.920
Um…

08:10.000 --> 08:12.840
I think maybe you need
to bend back some more.

08:12.920 --> 08:14.120
Okay.

08:23.920 --> 08:27.280
All right, let's see what you wrote.
You finish pretty fast, huh?

08:27.360 --> 08:29.080
-But I work hard, Mom.
-Aha…

08:29.160 --> 08:30.240
All right, let me see.

08:30.320 --> 08:32.840
Your mom made
stir-fried sugar snap peas again.

08:32.920 --> 08:34.480
Whose favorite is that?

08:37.120 --> 08:38.960
How did it go today, at school?

08:39.600 --> 08:41.920
My English teacher assigned us
an essay today.

08:42.000 --> 08:44.200
Dad, it was longer than usual, too.

08:44.280 --> 08:46.560
-Ohh.
-Listen to this.

08:46.640 --> 08:48.800
"My idol is a workaholic.

08:49.520 --> 08:54.680
He has a lot of work to do.
But never forgets to have time for me.

08:55.640 --> 09:00.080
He talks slow and calm but never hesitates
to give me the warmest smile."

09:01.160 --> 09:03.840
"He has only one love
but it's not exactly one love."

09:03.920 --> 09:04.960
Mom.

09:05.040 --> 09:06.880
-"Because he has two hearts…
-Mo…

09:06.960 --> 09:10.080
-…one for me and one for my Mom."
-Mom, that's enough.

09:10.160 --> 09:12.440
-"I'm glad to be his daughter."
-Mom, please stop.

09:12.920 --> 09:14.360
-"My idol, my Dad."
-Enough.

09:14.440 --> 09:16.080
Fine. I'm done.

09:16.160 --> 09:17.720
Why do you always have to embarrass me

09:17.800 --> 09:19.240
-like that?
-Why?

09:20.360 --> 09:22.000
Why are you so shy about it, huh?

09:22.080 --> 09:24.280
Don't be embarrassed.
Your essay is good.

09:36.320 --> 09:37.280
Nanno.

09:37.360 --> 09:39.360
Nanno, we don't want to be late.
We should go.

09:40.400 --> 09:41.680
I'm sorry, Ing.

09:41.760 --> 09:43.560
Win told me to tell you that…

09:44.080 --> 09:46.680
he doesn't have time to film us today.

09:48.400 --> 09:49.600
Oh…

09:49.680 --> 09:51.320
That's good. I can go home early.

09:52.440 --> 09:53.760
Okay, I think I'm gonna go then.

09:53.840 --> 09:55.280
-Bye.
-Bye-bye.

09:55.360 --> 09:56.560
Mei, bye-bye.

09:59.040 --> 10:00.440
Mei, what were you saying?

10:01.560 --> 10:04.760
Hmm… No, I'm… I'm leaving, too.

10:04.840 --> 10:06.640
I didn't… I wasn't saying anything.

10:23.640 --> 10:24.800
Hello, Win.

10:25.680 --> 10:26.840
Oh, Nanno.

10:28.360 --> 10:29.200
Where's Ing at?

10:29.760 --> 10:31.200
Ing isn't feeling well today.

10:31.680 --> 10:32.600
Really?

10:33.800 --> 10:36.880
Hmm… do you want to cancel our session?

10:37.680 --> 10:39.320
Oh, we can't do that.

10:39.400 --> 10:41.560
The thing is,
we're already behind schedule.

10:42.520 --> 10:44.600
So, let's just film you alone, okay?

10:45.160 --> 10:46.000
Sure.

10:46.480 --> 10:47.680
All right, get ready.

10:56.200 --> 10:57.560
Start anytime now, Nanno.

11:44.800 --> 11:46.240
I think you're too tired.

11:49.680 --> 11:50.880
Do you need a break?

11:59.920 --> 12:01.480
Are you sure about this?

12:04.760 --> 12:05.920
Why wouldn't I be?

12:10.360 --> 12:13.240
Just want to make sure you know
what you're doing.

12:44.800 --> 12:47.640
You do know
what you have to do now, right?

12:54.920 --> 12:56.240
Meet me tomorrow at the same time.

12:57.480 --> 12:58.480
Okay.

13:28.680 --> 13:29.840
Come in, Mei.

13:34.480 --> 13:35.560
Hi, Ma'am.

13:36.120 --> 13:37.040
I…

13:37.600 --> 13:41.160
I need to talk to you…
about something serious.

13:41.760 --> 13:43.200
Of course, have a seat.

13:44.920 --> 13:46.480
Now, what's going on?

13:52.960 --> 13:54.760
You can talk to me about anything.

13:54.840 --> 13:56.040
You don't have to worry.

14:01.200 --> 14:02.200
Well…

14:03.400 --> 14:04.760
A friend of mine.

14:06.400 --> 14:07.480
She's…

14:08.560 --> 14:09.720
pregnant.

14:12.280 --> 14:13.360
Okay.

14:15.640 --> 14:19.560
Has she told her parents anything
about what's going on yet?

14:21.920 --> 14:24.720
Not yet. They don't know anything.

14:26.040 --> 14:26.960
And…

14:27.680 --> 14:29.280
has she told the father anything?

14:34.440 --> 14:36.040
-Hmm.
-But…

14:38.120 --> 14:39.360
the father…

14:41.440 --> 14:43.080
He wants her to…

14:44.440 --> 14:45.640
have…

14:47.720 --> 14:48.800
an abortion.

14:50.040 --> 14:51.040
Hmm…

14:53.400 --> 14:55.640
And is that what your friend wants to do?

15:00.200 --> 15:03.080
Actually, there are many solutions
to this problem.

15:03.160 --> 15:05.320
Like she could drop out and come back

15:05.400 --> 15:07.720
-to school after--
-But my friend don't want to do that.

15:09.560 --> 15:12.920
Okay. Then I kind of understand now.

15:13.880 --> 15:15.880
So what did you want to talk to me about?

15:18.440 --> 15:19.480
Ma'am…

15:20.680 --> 15:22.120
do you happen to know where…

15:23.120 --> 15:24.240
she…

15:29.160 --> 15:30.720
could get an abortion?

15:36.360 --> 15:37.280
Mei.

15:38.000 --> 15:39.520
If that's what you really want,

15:40.080 --> 15:41.680
I can take you there.

15:45.640 --> 15:46.520
But…

15:46.600 --> 15:49.240
-it's not me. It's not me.
-Wait, Mei. Please, I…

15:54.520 --> 15:56.480
I know a place you can go.

15:56.560 --> 15:58.040
If you want me to take you.

16:01.880 --> 16:03.800
You didn't close the door all the way.

16:05.080 --> 16:06.400
But don't worry about it.

16:07.240 --> 16:08.640
I'm not going to tell anyone.

16:13.600 --> 16:15.120
I can take you there.

16:18.920 --> 16:20.200
Don't cry.

16:30.520 --> 16:31.640
Nanno, Ing.

16:32.120 --> 16:34.960
I'm afraid I need to cancel today.
Something just came up.

16:35.040 --> 16:36.160
-Okay.
-Sure.

16:36.240 --> 16:39.360
You, Nanno, why don't you meet me
in the video lab after lunch, okay?

16:39.440 --> 16:41.280
I need to reshoot
some of what we did yesterday.

16:41.360 --> 16:42.360
It won't take long.

16:43.160 --> 16:44.000
Yeah.

16:44.080 --> 16:45.440
Don't you want me to be there, too?

16:45.520 --> 16:47.760
No, I don't. They're only Nanno's scenes.

16:47.840 --> 16:49.120
-Oh.
-See you then.

16:51.080 --> 16:52.880
Didn't he cancel yesterday?

16:52.960 --> 16:54.760
He changed his mind
after you already left.

16:54.840 --> 16:56.040
He said he was behind.

16:57.040 --> 17:00.440
Hey, then you got to be alone with him.

17:00.520 --> 17:02.680
I'm so jealous of you, girl.

17:02.760 --> 17:05.640
Can you pretend to be sick
so I can be alone with him next time?

17:20.240 --> 17:22.400
Aren't you afraid
that someone will come in here?

17:22.480 --> 17:24.360
Hmm… don't worry.

17:24.960 --> 17:27.000
This is my private space.

17:27.520 --> 17:28.440
No.

17:28.920 --> 17:30.320
It's our private space.

17:30.920 --> 17:32.920
No one can come here
without my permission.

17:42.200 --> 17:43.200
Okay then.

17:44.720 --> 17:46.120
I have something to show you.

18:02.600 --> 18:04.040
You look great on film.

18:12.400 --> 18:13.720
Win.

18:13.800 --> 18:15.480
You have a family, don't you?

18:18.200 --> 18:19.800
Let's not talk about that.

18:19.880 --> 18:21.520
We don't have much time.

18:22.720 --> 18:25.520
But Win, you do know…

18:25.600 --> 18:27.120
…that what we're doing is wrong.

18:30.640 --> 18:33.240
Aren't you afraid
of the consequences of your actions?

18:37.520 --> 18:39.200
The consequences of my actions?

18:41.000 --> 18:43.280
I don't think you wanna know
what the consequences will be.

18:46.720 --> 18:48.520
If I decide to release this video,

18:49.760 --> 18:50.920
what will happen to you?

18:53.600 --> 18:55.480
You don't want me to release them, do you?

19:46.600 --> 19:47.600
Wan.

19:49.360 --> 19:51.840
I'm so hungry.
What are you making for dinner?

19:57.920 --> 19:59.440
Wan, is something wrong?

20:06.400 --> 20:08.600
But where did you find this?

20:09.760 --> 20:10.720
Where?

20:18.040 --> 20:19.200
I didn't find it.

20:19.280 --> 20:21.440
A girl named Nanno returned it.

20:22.520 --> 20:24.160
She seems like a nice girl.

20:24.240 --> 20:25.920
You forgot your cell phone,

20:26.000 --> 20:29.880
and she asked Troe for our address
then she came straight from school.

20:31.880 --> 20:34.200
That girl, she already went home, right?

20:34.680 --> 20:36.040
No, she's upstairs right now.

20:36.520 --> 20:39.920
Those two get along so well
so I invited her to stay for dinner.

20:43.840 --> 20:45.680
She might need to go home early, Wan.

20:46.760 --> 20:48.560
No. I already asked her.

20:54.120 --> 20:55.200
Thank you.

21:08.200 --> 21:09.280
Thank you, Ma'am.

21:12.680 --> 21:14.640
I really think
you should eat more, Nanno.

21:14.720 --> 21:16.520
Don't you think you need
to gain some weight?

21:16.600 --> 21:18.080
'Cause you're so thin right now.

21:18.160 --> 21:19.000
Really?

21:19.640 --> 21:21.920
But your father told me
that I had a good body.

21:23.280 --> 21:25.680
That's why he asked me
to be in his yoga video.

21:26.360 --> 21:28.680
So you're the one helping Win
with his video.

21:29.960 --> 21:32.960
You do look very athletic.
I'm sure you're great at yoga.

21:34.160 --> 21:36.080
Thank you so much.

21:36.160 --> 21:38.280
You should join us
when we're filming sometime.

21:38.360 --> 21:40.200
The three of us can have fun.

21:44.440 --> 21:46.400
Is Nanno good at yoga, Dad?

21:47.440 --> 21:49.880
-Hmm… I say, uh--
-I'm not good at it.

21:49.960 --> 21:51.640
Your Dad is the expert.

21:52.120 --> 21:54.160
He taught me so many difficult positions.

21:54.800 --> 21:56.360
Completely tired me out, didn't you?

21:58.440 --> 22:02.720
Not really. Actually, I think that…
you acquired a lot of experience already.

22:03.440 --> 22:05.000
Don't be humble, Nanno.

22:06.200 --> 22:08.440
Nanno is very smart, Mom.

22:08.520 --> 22:11.760
She helped me with some
of my really hard homework just now.

22:11.840 --> 22:13.960
What was the homework subject
that she help you with?

22:14.040 --> 22:15.800
It was the essay
about my role model.

22:15.880 --> 22:18.360
Thank you, Nanno.
I read it and it was really great.

22:18.960 --> 22:20.480
It's not a problem at all.

22:20.560 --> 22:22.760
What Vaew had written was already good.

22:22.840 --> 22:24.960
I almost cried while I was reading it.

22:25.640 --> 22:28.480
You're lucky you have
such an amazing father.

22:29.160 --> 22:31.520
Don't tease me like that, Nanno.

22:31.600 --> 22:33.000
I'm not teasing you.

22:33.800 --> 22:37.600
You don't believe me? Look at my tears.

22:37.680 --> 22:39.240
I've got an idea.

22:39.320 --> 22:42.240
Whenever you're available,
how about you tutor Vaew?

22:43.080 --> 22:46.920
Win and I had been so busy lately.
Both of us are always working late.

22:49.200 --> 22:54.760
Uh… Hey, Wan, I don't think…
That won't be necessary at all.

22:54.840 --> 22:56.640
Nanno's very busy with her homework.

22:56.720 --> 22:58.760
But I wouldn't make her
come every day.

22:59.280 --> 23:02.040
She can drop by whenever,
if she's available.

23:02.120 --> 23:03.840
It's not a big deal, Win.

23:03.920 --> 23:06.520
Do you any idea how hard
high school students study?

23:08.240 --> 23:09.400
Right, Nanno?

23:09.480 --> 23:10.560
No, I'd love to.

23:11.120 --> 23:13.520
Tutoring Vaew would be a great opportunity

23:13.600 --> 23:15.320
to review everything I've learned.

23:15.400 --> 23:16.560
I'll do it.

23:17.920 --> 23:21.640
Well then, how about we start
tomorrow since I have to work late?

23:21.720 --> 23:22.720
I'll be happy to.

23:22.800 --> 23:25.040
Call me later
so we can arrange the schedule.

23:25.120 --> 23:28.080
Yay! Nanno, I'm so glad you can do it.

23:30.480 --> 23:33.880
Actually, I think you can invite
some friends, as well, Vaew.

23:34.520 --> 23:36.240
I won't charge extra.

23:36.320 --> 23:38.480
-Really?
-Of course.

23:54.960 --> 23:56.320
Win.

23:56.400 --> 23:58.520
You have a family, don't you?

23:58.600 --> 24:01.680
Let's not talk
about that. We don't have much time.

24:02.440 --> 24:04.240
But Win, you do know

24:04.320 --> 24:05.680
that what we're doing is wrong.

24:06.160 --> 24:08.560
Aren't you afraid
of the consequences of your actions?

24:09.040 --> 24:11.040
If I decide to release this video,

24:11.120 --> 24:12.320
what will happen to you?

24:13.640 --> 24:15.440
You don't want me to release it, do you?

24:21.040 --> 24:24.600
YOU KNOW WHAT YOU HAVE TO DO
ABOUT US, RIGHT?

24:44.160 --> 24:46.360
Ing, have you seen Nanno or Mei?

24:46.440 --> 24:48.880
Uh… they're both out sick today.

24:51.040 --> 24:52.240
Excuse me, sir.

24:52.320 --> 24:53.760
Are we gonna be filming today?

24:53.840 --> 24:54.720
We can't film today.

24:56.160 --> 24:59.440
Weren't you in a rush, sir?
I'm available.

25:04.320 --> 25:05.400
Shit.

25:07.040 --> 25:08.080
Hello.

25:09.640 --> 25:10.800
What are you up to?

25:11.360 --> 25:12.920
What do you think I'm up to?

25:13.560 --> 25:14.880
Don't act so innocent.

25:14.960 --> 25:16.680
You fucking stole my phone.

25:18.040 --> 25:20.000
Did you think I kept those videos on it?

25:21.600 --> 25:22.640
I'm not an idiot.

25:23.120 --> 25:24.840
I didn't steal your phone.

25:24.920 --> 25:26.520
I'm pretty sure you forgot it yourself.

25:27.200 --> 25:29.000
Otherwise, I wouldn't have returned it.

25:30.440 --> 25:31.960
What are you up to?

25:32.040 --> 25:35.040
Not only did you go to my house,
but you threatened me.

25:37.440 --> 25:41.120
You seem to like recording things.
So I sent you something.

25:41.200 --> 25:42.960
I thought you might enjoy it.

25:44.200 --> 25:45.400
Don't you forget…

25:46.400 --> 25:48.160
I still have that video of you.

25:49.000 --> 25:50.320
And once I release it to everyone,

25:51.000 --> 25:52.520
what do you think will happen to you?

25:53.000 --> 25:54.000
I don't know.

25:58.560 --> 26:00.520
You have to stop messing with my family.

26:01.760 --> 26:02.840
Do you understand?

26:02.920 --> 26:04.160
Absolutely.

26:06.640 --> 26:08.360
And you meet me at the video lab.

26:10.240 --> 26:11.920
Same time tonight.

26:12.480 --> 26:13.360
Do you understand?

26:14.400 --> 26:15.680
Absolutely.

26:18.640 --> 26:20.280
We understand each other, then.

26:28.960 --> 26:30.000
Nanno.

26:30.840 --> 26:33.520
You have to be really careful
with someone like that.

26:34.720 --> 26:36.520
You don't have to worry about me, Mei.

26:45.120 --> 26:46.920
FEMALE REPRODUCTIVE SYSTEM

26:52.320 --> 26:53.320
Mei.

26:55.200 --> 26:57.040
You should decide for yourself.

27:29.800 --> 27:31.440
Are you still watching the video?

27:32.040 --> 27:33.440
This is a better view.

27:34.160 --> 27:35.280
Oh, please.

27:38.160 --> 27:40.720
I'm really happy
that I got to spend time with you.

27:45.280 --> 27:47.200
Should we study at my house next time?

27:47.800 --> 27:50.600
And can we tell Nanno
to come half an hour late?

27:52.480 --> 27:53.480
No.

27:55.080 --> 27:56.080
Why not?

27:57.040 --> 27:58.760
My mom really wants to meet you, Babe.

27:59.880 --> 28:00.800
No.

28:03.600 --> 28:07.000
Uh, by the way, do you know what time
your parents are coming home?

28:07.480 --> 28:08.640
Hmm…

28:09.400 --> 28:10.520
In a few hours.

28:11.080 --> 28:11.960
Why?

28:28.400 --> 28:29.400
Hey, Nanno.

28:30.160 --> 28:32.040
I'm sorry, the front door was locked.

28:34.040 --> 28:35.120
Oh.

28:37.360 --> 28:38.680
Is this your boyfriend?

28:38.760 --> 28:40.520
-Yes, nice to meet you.
-Not really.

28:42.000 --> 28:43.480
He's not my boyfriend.

28:43.960 --> 28:45.240
All right, then, I believe you.

28:46.520 --> 28:47.800
Hmm…

28:49.320 --> 28:52.320
So, do you guys want to go
somewhere else to study?

29:13.320 --> 29:14.720
MR. WIN
SLIDE TO ANSWER

29:16.920 --> 29:18.200
Is there something wrong?

29:19.280 --> 29:21.400
I think I need to run an errand outside.

29:22.000 --> 29:22.880
Now?

29:23.680 --> 29:26.400
Then, do you want me to go with you?

29:26.480 --> 29:27.560
No, that's okay.

29:28.160 --> 29:29.560
You two wait here.

29:31.280 --> 29:32.160
Are you sure?

29:32.840 --> 29:33.840
Yes, I'm sure.

29:36.200 --> 29:38.040
Will you be gone for a long time?

29:41.520 --> 29:42.680
Not too long.

29:43.600 --> 29:46.400
I should be done in about an hour.

29:50.920 --> 29:52.560
Vaew, can I borrow your phone?

29:56.680 --> 29:57.960
Here you go.

29:58.040 --> 30:00.560
Thanks so much.
Make yourself at home. Bye.

30:15.600 --> 30:16.640
Hey.

30:18.520 --> 30:19.760
What should we do now?

30:20.640 --> 30:21.600
I don't know.

30:26.240 --> 30:27.120
What?

30:52.840 --> 30:54.200
Hello there.

30:54.800 --> 30:56.440
You're so impatient.

30:56.520 --> 30:58.200
What do you think you're doing?

30:58.280 --> 31:00.000
Don't you mess with me.

31:00.080 --> 31:01.520
Do you think I won't release it?

31:03.320 --> 31:04.760
It's not that.

31:04.840 --> 31:06.960
I just had something to take care of

31:07.440 --> 31:08.880
but I'm almost there.

31:10.720 --> 31:12.480
You have exactly 15 minutes.

31:12.560 --> 31:14.680
I'll release the video
if you're not here by then.

31:29.920 --> 31:32.760
Hey, come over here.

31:32.840 --> 31:34.120
What do you mean?

31:36.680 --> 31:37.840
What are you doing?

31:38.960 --> 31:40.520
Vaew.

31:40.600 --> 31:42.080
If you love me,

31:42.160 --> 31:43.280
you'll let this happen.

31:43.840 --> 31:45.160
Like what happen?

32:06.920 --> 32:08.320
What is it, Nanno?

32:09.520 --> 32:12.640
I'm here. The gate is closed.

32:13.400 --> 32:14.920
Can you come and get me?

32:19.400 --> 32:20.560
Be right there.

33:12.640 --> 33:13.960
Hello there, Win.

33:14.840 --> 33:17.000
Sorry to have kept you waiting.

33:17.080 --> 33:18.320
What the hell are you doing?

33:19.440 --> 33:20.520
Why are you up there?

33:23.440 --> 33:27.440
On the computers here,
there are so many interesting folders.

33:28.440 --> 33:30.200
Do you mind
if I take a look at them?

33:31.360 --> 33:32.640
Come down here then.

33:33.400 --> 33:34.640
I'll show you.

33:35.200 --> 33:36.840
I can't go down there.

33:37.560 --> 33:39.120
I think you're too dangerous.

33:40.440 --> 33:42.280
Why are you hiding up there?

33:42.360 --> 33:44.880
Without a password, you have nothing.

33:45.360 --> 33:47.200
Come down and let's talk about it.

33:52.800 --> 33:54.440
Even though I can't get to them,

33:55.040 --> 33:58.040
I think I still have something fun
to show you.

33:58.120 --> 34:00.560
If I know you, you'll definitely like it.

34:10.360 --> 34:11.280
Vaew.

34:11.760 --> 34:12.960
What are you doing to her?

34:14.040 --> 34:15.400
What am I doing?

34:16.360 --> 34:17.560
What did you do?

34:17.640 --> 34:19.560
I'm not doing anything at all.

34:20.840 --> 34:22.400
To be totally honest,

34:22.480 --> 34:24.720
your daughter
seems to be enjoying herself.

34:24.800 --> 34:26.080
Do you have a condom?

34:27.840 --> 34:29.000
No.

34:29.800 --> 34:32.720
-Do you want me to turn up the volume?
-Don't worry, I'll be careful.

34:33.800 --> 34:35.000
I'm gonna kill you.

34:41.880 --> 34:44.880
-Vaew, Vaew.
-Hello, Daddy.

34:44.960 --> 34:48.680
I'm in the middle of a Biology lesson.

34:49.200 --> 34:50.800
But I'm almost done.

34:54.120 --> 34:58.240
Num, are you sure
we should do this?

34:58.320 --> 35:00.240
We don't even have a condom.

35:00.320 --> 35:02.400
-Nanno, open it.
-I can see, okay.

35:02.480 --> 35:03.800
You better come down right now!

35:05.040 --> 35:07.880
Come on, now.

35:07.960 --> 35:09.800
If something bad happens to me,

35:10.360 --> 35:14.400
you'll never find Vaew.
And God knows what might happen to her.

35:15.160 --> 35:16.280
Where is she?

35:18.920 --> 35:20.320
I said where is my daughter?

35:22.240 --> 35:24.120
Maybe I should broadcast all this live.

35:24.200 --> 35:26.240
She would probably get
a lot of likes.

35:26.920 --> 35:29.040
Nanno, I'm begging you.
Where is my daughter?

35:30.400 --> 35:32.680
You need to try a little harder than that.

35:32.760 --> 35:34.240
Something like…

35:34.320 --> 35:36.000
getting down on your knees and begging me.

35:45.480 --> 35:49.160
Where is my daughter?

35:49.240 --> 35:50.360
Okay, okay.

35:51.320 --> 35:53.160
You did what I asked, I'm gonna tell you.

35:54.800 --> 35:56.800
But I still want to know the password.

35:56.880 --> 35:58.120
Shit!

35:59.440 --> 36:00.520
Shit.

36:01.040 --> 36:02.720
You really should get going.

36:02.800 --> 36:05.240
Vaew is waiting for her daddy
to come home.

36:05.320 --> 36:07.880
No, actually, her role model.

36:07.960 --> 36:10.840
And if her role model daddy
doesn't decide soon,

36:10.920 --> 36:12.760
it might be too late.

36:12.840 --> 36:15.160
It'll be all over for Vaew.

37:07.160 --> 37:08.360
Who's texting you?

37:09.400 --> 37:10.320
Don't worry about it.

37:10.400 --> 37:11.600
Another girl?

37:11.680 --> 37:13.880
-Let me see.
-Hey, it's nothing. It's nothing.

37:13.960 --> 37:15.600
-What is it?
-It's nothing.

37:39.880 --> 37:43.840
DO YOU WANT TO SEE
SOMETHING FUN, WAN?

37:53.960 --> 37:55.440
-Dad.
-You little bastard!

37:55.520 --> 37:56.920
-What?
-What did you do to her?

37:57.000 --> 37:59.800
Dad! Stop right now! Dad.

37:59.880 --> 38:01.360
Dad! Dad!

38:01.440 --> 38:05.240
COME TO THIS LOCATION
IF YOU WANT TO SEE MORE.

38:06.320 --> 38:07.480
LOCATION

38:07.560 --> 38:08.560
SHARE LOCATION

38:13.800 --> 38:16.400
Dad. I'm begging you. Stop, Dad!

38:16.480 --> 38:17.440
Come here.

38:19.200 --> 38:20.760
How could you be so disgusting?

38:24.600 --> 38:26.280
If I'm disgusting…

38:29.840 --> 38:31.480
…then what does that make you?

38:40.840 --> 38:42.760
Vaew. Vaew!

38:43.520 --> 38:44.760
Vaew.

38:44.840 --> 38:45.680
Stop now, Vaew.

38:45.760 --> 38:47.480
-I told you to stop.
-Let go!

38:47.560 --> 38:49.760
Let go of me now.

38:59.000 --> 39:01.840
-I'm sorry.
-I wish I wasn't your daughter!

39:13.000 --> 39:14.040
Vaew!

39:18.360 --> 39:19.600
Vaew! Vaew!

39:20.320 --> 39:21.480
Please be okay.

39:22.080 --> 39:23.280
You can't die.

39:24.280 --> 39:25.200
Vaew!

39:26.680 --> 39:27.800
Vaew!

39:27.880 --> 39:29.000
Vaew, don't die!

39:29.640 --> 39:30.680
Vaew!

39:31.960 --> 39:33.760
Vaew!

39:33.840 --> 39:35.760
Are you sure about this?

39:36.360 --> 39:37.480
Why wouldn't I be?

39:56.360 --> 39:58.960
Just want to make sure you know
what you're doing.

40:30.040 --> 40:31.160
Hello, Ma'am.

40:32.360 --> 40:35.000
Thank you so much for all of your help.

40:35.080 --> 40:38.040
I've decided to quit school
to have the baby.

40:38.960 --> 40:40.240
It's for the best.

40:40.800 --> 40:43.400
I hope we get to see you again, someday.

40:44.480 --> 40:46.760
As for the attached photos and videos,

40:47.480 --> 40:49.360
you can do whatever you like with them.

40:52.240 --> 40:54.600
I'll miss you, Mali.

40:56.120 --> 40:57.320
Goodbye.

40:58.720 --> 41:00.880
-Let me in, sir.
-Let us in, please.

41:00.960 --> 41:03.680
Let me in, sir.
This is a big story that affects children.

41:03.760 --> 41:07.280
Somebody stop and make way.

41:10.120 --> 41:11.720
Please let me in, now!

41:11.800 --> 41:14.440
-Let me in now.
-It's the principal of the school.

41:44.720 --> 41:46.240
Nanno!

41:55.040 --> 41:58.120
I'm going to kill you!
